{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"第一眼落在左上方最大号的白字标题和金色强调词“憋着一股气”“当作自己人”；随后视线容易被中部同样醒目的大号灰白标题吸引。上下两块大字都具有较强视觉权重。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他心里还憋着一股气，想起从前曾有人把他当作自己人，因而短暂高兴。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"憋闷、有怨气，夹杂着短暂的高兴；后续的酸楚和失落不一定能在第一眼完整抓到。\",\n  \"missed\": \"那点高兴还没消退就转为酸楚，因为从前的日子已经回不去，而离开以后是否真的会更好也没有答案。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上下两块字号接近、都很醒目的大字标题争夺主视线。\",\n    \"核心情绪变化分散在两块大字中，需要把上面的短暂高兴和下面的酸楚拼接起来才能理解完整。\",\n    \"两块大字本身都包含较长的叙述和转折，快速扫视不容易一次拿全关系。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "de8e8cef-ff71-4a93-8369-2788e46fd9ce", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T012212138205Z", "elapsed_seconds": 32.891, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:22:45.038536+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "865268096b6cf1daea18484b8c477702c1ff41a3f13daa850497c25f3a96c5ea", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4